        <activityName xml:lang="en">Supply air input/spent air output cogen unit 160kWe</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Supply air input/spent air output cogen unit 160kWe
Inventory refers to infrastructure of an existing natural gas cogeneration plant (lambda=1 motor, 160kWe, operation start 1987) at Jakobsberg, Basel, Switzerland. (Life time for operation assumed 100'000 h.);
UUID: c0005513-9e4d-30b4-93f4-6049d2d4d2e8
The module includes the most important materials used for production. It includes also the transport of these materials and the energy and water needed for production.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Component of a specific cogeneration unit installed in Switzerland. Technology at end of 1980s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c0005513-9e4d-30b4-93f4-6049d2d4d2e8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
